{
  "id": "LEV.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "LEV",
  "reference": "Walawi 11",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iro nyamandu rifwanagha kujighwa na risefwanagha kujighwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko BWANA ukawizera Musa na Haruni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Muwizere wandu wa Israeli huwu, Iri niro nyamandu rejighwa aghadi ya nyamandu rose riko ndoenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamandu rose riko na kochokocho ribarikie na kuwaghika, rikeragha vindo vawo na kuvidafuna sena, iro nyamandu mwadima kurija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elaima, aghadi ya iro nyamandu rikeragha, na kukaia na kochokocho ribarilo risewaghikie, mseje iri: Ngamila angu ikeragha ela kochokocho rake nderiwaghikie, iyo ni nyamandu iseelie konyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njiwu rakeragha vindo vawo, ela nderiwadie kochokocho riwaghikie, mseje; ni nyamandu iseelie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaru wakeragha vindo vake, ela ndewadie kochokocho, mseje, ni nyamandu iseelie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguwe yawadie kochokocho riwaghikie ela ndeikeragha vindo vake, mseje, ni nyamandu iseelie konyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamandu iri rose mserije, hata gharia rawo mseriadade, ni nyamandu riseelie konyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyamandu rose ra machinyi reja ni iri: Icho chose chiko na mapezi na makoko mwadima kuja, chikaiagha baharinyi angu medenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nyamandu rose risene mapezi na makoko, rikaiagha baharinyi na medenyi, nderielie; mseje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Richadua wuchafu konyu, mserije, hata gharia rawo mseriadade. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamandu rose ra machinyi riko moyo risewadie mapezi angu makoko mserije.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iri niro nyonyi riseelie, risedimagha kujighwa, naro ni: indu, nderi na mbungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kisangangoju, luwighi na vichuku vake; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kula ngorusa na vichuku vake, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyagha, kungumuzi, mashanda na vichuku vake; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mkungi na iro rifwanane nagho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mnyange, igembe-gembe, nderi ya kichuku chimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korongo, koi koi na kichuku chake, hudi hudi na iososi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wadudu wose wiko na maghu awa wiburukagha ni wuchafu konyu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela awo wiko na maghu ana na ndangachu rerama, mwadima kuwija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iri mwadima kuja: zighe, na vichuku varo; mwaparangia na vichuku varo; na weke mwapazi na vichuku varo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wadudu wose wa maghu ana wiburukagha ni wuchafu konyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na mundu uo ose uchaadada gharia ra nyamandu iri uchakaia useelie hata luma kwa kenyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na uo ose uchaadwa kipande cha gharia yaro, suti uoghoshe nguwo rake, nao utalo useelie hata luma lwa kenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula nyamandu iko na kocho kocho risebarilo, na kuwaghika, hata isekeragha na kudafuna vindo vake, ndeielie konyu; uo ose uchaariadada uchakaia useelie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na iro rose ra maghu ana righendagha na vala vawo, nderielie konyu. Uo ose uchaadada gharia rawo, uchakaia useelie hata luma lwa kenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na uo udukagha gharia rawo, suti uoghoshe nguwo rake, sena uchakaia useelie hata luma lwa kenyi, iro nderielie konyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na iri naro ni wuchafu konyu. Shimandu rose riavuagha andoenyi; weke mwacheche, mbewa, wukanda na vichuku varo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "weke mwalukandua, weke mamba, weke mwaluchorongo, na malunji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimandu iri ni wuchafu konyu, na uo ose uchaariadada gharia rawo, uchakaia useelie hata luma lwa kenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gharia rawo rikapotokia kilambo chingi, chichakaia chiseelie; chikaiagha ni m'bau, nguwo, kishoo, angu igunia, na kilambo icho chose chitumilwagha kwa wundu ghungi, suti chioghosho, sena chitalo kukaia chiseelie hata luma lwa kenyi, ima chicherumirikia kukaia chaela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingi ya iro shimandu, ikapotokia kilambo chingi cha wongo, icho chose chiko andenyi ya icho kilambo, chichakaia chiseelie; na icho kilambo chichabarwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icho chose chikoghe cheja, chikatonyerwa ni machi ghafuma kwa icho kilambo, chichakaia chiseelie, machi ghose ghifumagha kwa icho kilambo, ghisenyugho; ndeghielie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilambo icho chose chikapotokelwa ni shimandu ifue, chichatalwa kukaia chiseelie; ikaiagha na iriko ja wongo angu ovuna, suti vibaro; vichakaia viseelie konyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elaima, ndoria ra machi angu chombo cha wongo chiwadie machi vichakaia vielie, ela vilambo ivo vose vichaadadana na gharia ra iro shimandu, vichakaia viseelie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kipande chingi cha iyo gharia chikapotokia mbeu ewalwa, iyo mbeu ichakaia ielie; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela iyo gharia ikapotokia mbeu idungilo machi, iyo mbeu ichakaia iseelie konyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyamandu ingi ijighwaghwa ikafwa, na mndungi uwade gharia yake, uchakaia useelie hata luma lwa kenyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na uo ose uchaaja nyama yake, uchaoghosha nguwo rake, sena uchakaia useelie hata luma lwa kenyi; na wokoni, uo uchaadwa gharia ya iyo nyamandu, uchaoghosha nguwo rake, sena uchakaia useelie hata luma lwa kenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kula shimandu iavuagha andoenyi ni wuchafu; mseije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo yose isololokagha na kifu chake, angu kughenda kwa maghu ana angu maghu mengi; shimandu rose riavuagha andoenyi mserije; ni wuchafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msekulushe inyo mmbeni kwa kuja iro shimandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ini ne BWANA Mlungu onyu; kwa huwo mukueleshe mmbeni, mkaie muelie, angu ini ne Mweli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wal. 19.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet. 1.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ini ne BWANA, uo oremfunyireghe isanga ja Misri, eri nipate kukaia Mlungu onyu, kwa huwo mchakaia muelie angu Ini ne Mweli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
